    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summoned to gloomy Port Gelour by a cryptic letter, Leon the alchemist is compelled to investigate. In this 2D hand-drawn adventure game inspired by eldritch fiction, you will collect exotic ingredients, brew potent potions, solve puzzles, befriend eccentric locals, and unravel the lurking horror. Leon's quest will take you both to various locations from dank sewers to forgotten ocean coves, from humble cottages to opulent mansions. He doesn't yet understand what lurks beneath the waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449530/extras/f4d26be01e5650da1918964cd8fe6c71.avif?t=1745269268\" width=600 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449530/extras/c099a2add4f869e80b3d8a61c51cd3da.poster.avif?t=1745269268\" width=800 height=520 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449530/extras/c099a2add4f869e80b3d8a61c51cd3da.webm?t=1745269268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449530/extras/c099a2add4f869e80b3d8a61c51cd3da.mp4?t=1745269268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449530/extras/c6c2428936ddb912f2c4d0fce6a954a8.avif?t=1745269268\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449530/extras/e5ea6730aa858446648dd2a143762ce7.post